# Google Cloud / Google Drive
# Scope: Google Drive + Google Docs/Sheets/Slides + Drive for desktop
# Note: intentionally excludes broad shared Google infrastructure such as:
#       googleapis.com / googleusercontent.com / gstatic.com / accounts.google.com
#       so those requests can continue to fall through to the general Google policy.

# Google Drive core
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googledrive.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive.google.com

# Google Drive content / export endpoints
DOMAIN,drive.usercontent.google.com
DOMAIN,drive-data-export.usercontent.google.com
DOMAIN,drive-data-export-eu.usercontent.google.com

# Drive-integrated editors
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,docs.google.com
DOMAIN,sheets.google.com
DOMAIN,slides.google.com

# Google Drive for desktop
DOMAIN,fcmconnection.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,signaler-pa.googleapis.com
